    "which is the reminder to write one. The guard can only protect fields it",
    "knows about.",
    "JSON has no Vector3, so one is spelled {\"__vec3\": [x, y, z]}, and a",
    "Vector2i {\"__vec2i\": [x, y]}. Typed arrays keep their element type: the",
    "checker builds the new array from the field's current value."
